ked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Add},a_+\">\\(\\mathrm{Add},a_+\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55ffcef2e3fdc1d4\" href=\"?note=55ffcef2e3fdc1d4\" title=\"18-df-natural-addition\">18-df-natural-addition</a>；求值及函数项见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mult}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{Mult}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 用第二变量递归引入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mult}(x,0)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Mult}(x,y+1)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Add}(\\mathrm{Mult}(x,y),x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Mult}(x,0)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Mult}(x,y+1)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Add}(\\mathrm{Mult}(x,y),x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a_\\times\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rec}(C_0^1,\\operatorname{Sub}(a_+,P_3^3,P_2^3)),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Mult}(x,y)=\\operatorname{ev}(a_\\times,\\langle y,x\\rangle),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Mult}\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a_\\times\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rec}(C_0^1,\\operatorname{Sub}(a_+,P_3^3,P_2^3)),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Mult}(x,y)=\\operatorname{ev}(a_\\times,\\langle y,x\\rangle),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Mult}\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Exercise 2.1.5 的乘法练习。a_+ 求值时首参数为递归变量，故步函数投影次序为 (x,前值)，得到 Add(前值,x)。由自然数归纳核对递归方程。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-natural-addition","status":"resolved","id":"55ffcef2e3fdc1d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-natural-addition]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms","status":"resolved","id":"f04544345afa1f92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-natural-addition","status":"resolved","id":"55ffcef2e3fdc1d4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{Add},a_+$ 见 [[18-df-natural-addition]]；求值及函数项见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms","status":"resolved","id":"f04544345afa1f92","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{Add},a_+$ 见 [[18-df-natural-addition]]；求值及函数项见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Add},a_+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mult}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mult}(x,0)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Mult}(x,y+1)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Add}(\\mathrm{Mult}(x,y),x).","display":true},{"tex":"a_\\times\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rec}(C_0^1,\\operatorname{Sub}(a_+,P_3^3,P_2^3)),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Mult}(x,y)=\\operatorname{ev}(a_\\times,\\langle y,x\\rangle),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Mult}\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2.","display":true}],"bytes":1393,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-natural-multiplication]]"},{"id":"5ae0edef6e43d09e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depe